                <pb facs="0320" n="244" sameAs="frus:frus1935v02/pg244"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">851.4061 Motion Pictures/230: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Straus</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-10-31T15:00:00-05:00">October 31, 1935—3
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>441. Your 929, October 30, noon. I wish to convey to you and your staff my hearty
                    congratulations for the manner in which the motion picture question has been
                    handled.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
